{"warnings":{"main":{"warnings":"Unrecognized parameter: pilicense."}},"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":688726,"ns":0,"title":"Rupert Friend","revisions":[{"revid":15195150,"parentid":14774666,"timestamp":"2025-09-10T15:47:40Z","slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","content":"{{Top|rwp}}\n{{Person\n|image=[[File:RupertFriend.jpg]]\n|name=Rupert Friend\n|birth=\n|death=\n|listedpronouns=<!--Only include pronouns if they have been explicitly specified by the individual to which this article pertains.-->\n|nationality=\n|occupation=[[Wikipedia:Actor|Actor]]<ref name=\"Cast\">{{SW|url=news/obi-wan-kenobi-series-cast|text=Obi-Wan Kenobi Series to Begin Production in April, Cast Revealed}}</ref>\n|companies=\n|website=\n}}\n{{Quote|I really wanted to honor the [Grand Inquisitor] as I saw him, and so I almost deliberately did not see the animated interpretation. Myself and [director] Deb Chow and [writer] Dave Filoni and all of the guys really wanted to do something fresh that honored and was faithful to the spirit of the character without doing a kind of impression of anybody else's interpretation.|Rupert Friend|<ref name=\"GI Speaks\">{{WebCite|url=https://ew.com/tv/obi-wan-kenobi-grand-inquisitor-rupert-friend-interview|text=''Obi-Wan Kenobi''{{'s}} Grand Inquisitor speaks!|author=Ross, Dalton|date=2022-05-19|work=''[[Entertainment Weekly]]''|archivedate=20220519163118}}</ref>}}\n'''Rupert Friend''' is an actor, director, screenwriter, and producer. He portrayed [[The Grand Inquisitor]] in ''[[Star Wars: Obi-Wan Kenobi]]''.<ref name=\"Hightlights\">{{SW|url=news/obi-wan-kenobi-teaser-trailer-highlights|text=5 Highlights From the ''Obi-Wan Kenobi'' Teaser Trailer}}</ref>\n\n==Biography==\nThe actor Rupert Friend was cast to play the [[The Grand Inquisitor]] in the ''[[Star Wars: Obi-Wan Kenobi]]'' television series. He said that getting to be a part of ''[[Star Wars]]'' was a \"complete boyhood dream come true.\" Friend would constantly \"geek out\" on the set and he nearly fainted when he was handed [[The Grand Inquisitor's lightsaber|his lightsaber]]. The actor was excited about playing a character who has never appeared in live-action and said standing next to [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] was amazing. Friend wanted to honor the [[Grand Inquisitor]] as he saw him, so he almost deliberately didn't watch ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]''. Friend, director [[Deborah Chow]], [[Dave Filoni]], and the crew wanted a fresh portrayal that was faithful to the character's spirit without doing an impression of the animated version. Writer [[Joby Harold]] wrote that the Grand Inquisitor enjoys the sound of his own voice and talks a lot, so Friend spoke like someone who likes their own voice.<ref name=\"GI Speaks\" />\n\n[[File:GrandInquisitorTakesABreak.png|thumb|right|210px|Rupert Friend and Sung Kang on the [[Tatooine]] set]]\nFriend said that the [[Inquisitor]]'s backstory as a former [[Jedi]] brought an \"enormous kind of feeling of power beneath the performance.\"<ref name=\"GI Speaks\" /> Friend's [[lightsaber]] prop was shifted to accommodate his hands.<ref name=\"Weapons of Inquis\">{{SW|url=news/inside-the-lucasfilm-archive-obi-wan-kenobi-props-2|text=Inside the Lucasfilm Archive: Weapons of the Inquisitorius from the ''Obi-Wan Kenobi'' Limited Series}}</ref> The actor enjoyed going through lightsaber training with the stunt guys, who are master swordsmen and masters of several forms of [[Wikipedia:Martial arts|martial arts]]. The make-up and prosthetics took four hours to apply every day. Most mornings, Friend had three people working on him until the rest of the crew arrived. He thought it was a thrill to see \"this extraordinary creation come to life before [his] eyes each morning.\" All of the [[armor]] together weighed about 45 [[pound]]s and the [[cape]] was weighted with chains to move in \"a badass way.\" Friend felt invincible with the costume on. Between takes, the crew rushed to Friend to cool him off with neck fans they invented, though the actor still sweated a lot on set.<ref name=\"GI Speaks\" />\n\nFriend had a good time with [[Moses Ingram]] and [[Sung Kang]],<ref name=\"GI Speaks\" /> the actors who played the [[Reva Sevander|Third Sister]] and [[Fifth Brother]], respectively.<ref name=\"Part I\">{{Kenobi|Part I}}</ref> Friend loved how the three Inquisitors and their [[weapon]]s are distinct. He said that he would be completely open to playing the Grand Inquisitor in another piece of ''[[Star Wars]]'' because he loved playing his role and would like to see what would happen if he interacted with other characters.<ref name=\"GI Speaks\" /> On [[March 29]], [[2021]], [[Lucasfilm]] confirmed Rupert Friend as a cast member of the live-action [[Disney+]] television series ''[[Star Wars: Obi-Wan Kenobi]]''.<ref name=\"SW\">{{SW|url=news/obi-wan-kenobi-series-cast|text=Obi-Wan Kenobi Series to Begin Production in April, Cast Revealed}}</ref>\n\n==Works==\n===Filmography===\n{| {{Prettytable}}\n! Year !! Title !! Series !! Contribution(s)\n|-\n|[[2022]]||\"[[Part I]]\"||''[[Star Wars: Obi-Wan Kenobi]]''||[[The Grand Inquisitor]]<ref name=\"Hightlights\" />\n|-\n|2022||\"[[Part II]]\"||''Obi-Wan Kenobi''||The Grand Inquisitor<ref name=\"Part II\">{{Kenobi|Part II}}</ref>\n|-\n|2022||\"[[Part V]]\"||''Obi-Wan Kenobi''||The Grand Inquisitor<ref name=\"Part V\">{{Kenobi|Part V}}</ref>\n|-\n|2022||\"[[Part VI]]\"||''Obi-Wan Kenobi''||The Grand Inquisitor<ref name=\"Part VI\">{{Kenobi|Part VI}}</ref>\n|}\n\n==Sources==\n*{{SW|url=news/obi-wan-kenobi-series-cast|text=Obi-Wan Kenobi Series to Begin Production in April, Cast Revealed}}\n*{{InsiderCite|204|Launchpad}}\n*{{InsiderCite|205|Launchpad}}\n*{{InsiderCite|206|Launchpad}}\n*{{InsiderCite|207|Launchpad}}\n*{{InsiderCite|208|Launchpad}}\n*{{SW|url=news/obi-wan-kenobi-premiere-date|text=''Obi-Wan Kenobi'' Will Debut May 25 on Disney+}}\n*{{SW|url=news/obi-wan-kenobi-teaser-trailer-highlights|text=5 Highlights From the ''Obi-Wan Kenobi'' Teaser Trailer}}\n*{{InsiderCite|209|Launchpad}}\n*{{SW|url=news/obi-wan-kenobi-may-27|text=''Obi-Wan Kenobi'' to Premiere May 27 with Two Episodes}}\n*{{InsiderCite|210|Launchpad}}\n*{{SWYouTube|swclPDFHKNk|Star Wars Celebration LIVE! - DAY 1}}\n*{{SW|url=news/swca-2022-20-highlights-from-lucasfilms-studio-showcase|text=SWCA 2022: 20 Highlights from Lucasfilm's Studio Showcase}}\n*{{Kenobi|Part I}}\n*{{Kenobi|Part II}}\n*{{SWYouTube|cURr8orSszs|Lucasfilm Studio Showcase Recap &#124; Star Wars Celebration 2022}}\n*{{SW|url=news/obi-wan-kenobi-is-here|text=''Obi-Wan Kenobi'' is Here!}}\n*{{SWYouTube|dMEe6njO5fI|Moses Ingram & Rupert Friend Take the Stage at SWCA 2022 &#124; Star Wars Celebration LIVE!}}\n*{{SW|url=news/inside-the-lucasfilm-archive-obi-wan-kenobi-props-2|text=Inside the Lucasfilm Archive: Weapons of the Inquisitorius from the ''Obi-Wan Kenobi'' Limited Series}}\n\n==Notes and references==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n==External links==\n*{{Instagram|username=rupertfriend|name=Rupert Friend|archivedate=20140101084643}}\n*{{Twitter|username=rupertfriend|name=Rupert Friend|archivedate=20140122111607}}\n*{{WP|Rupert Friend}}\n*{{IMDb|name/nm1670029}}\n\n{{Interlang\n|es=Rupert Friend\n|fr=Rupert Friend\n|tr=Rupert Friend\n}}\n\n[[Category:Actors who have portrayed the Grand Inquisitor]]\n[[Category:Star Wars: Obi-Wan Kenobi actors]]"}}}],"original":{"source":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/7/7d/RupertFriend.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210329222622","width":383,"height":480},"pageimage":"RupertFriend.jpg","images":[{"ns":6,"title":"File:GrandInquisitorTakesABreak.png"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:IMDb.svg"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:Instagram-Logo.svg"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:Obi-Wan Kenobi new series logo.png"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:Premium-Era-real.png"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:RupertFriend.jpg"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:SWCustom-2011.png"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:SWInsider.png"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:SWYT-Logo.svg"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:TwitterLogo.svg"},{"ns":6,"title":"File:Wikipedia-Logo.svg"}],"pageprops":{"defaultsort":"Friend, Rupert","displaytitle":"Rupert Friend","fandomdescription":"Rupert Friend is an actor, director, screenwriter, and producer. He portrayed The Grand Inquisitor in Star Wars: Obi-Wan Kenobi.[3] The actor Rupert Friend was cast to play the The Grand Inquisitor in the Star Wars: Obi-Wan Kenobi television series. He said that getting to be a part of Star Wars was a \"complete boyhood dream come true.\" Friend would constantly \"geek out\" on the set and he nearly fainted when he was handed his lightsaber. The actor was excited about playing a character who has never appeared in...","infoboxes":"[{\"parser_tag_version\":5,\"data\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/static.wikia.nocookie.net\\/starwars\\/images\\/7\\/7d\\/RupertFriend.jpg\\/revision\\/latest?cb=20210329222622\",\"name\":\"RupertFriend.jpg\",\"key\":\"RupertFriend.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"isVideo\":false,\"item-name\":null,\"source\":\"image\"}]},{\"type\":\"title\",\"data\":{\"value\":\"Rupert Friend\",\"item-name\":null,\"source\":\"name\"}},{\"type\":\"group\",\"data\":{\"value\":[{\"type\":\"header\",\"data\":{\"value\":\"Career\",\"item-name\":null,\"source\":null}},{\"type\":\"data\",\"data\":{\"label\":\"Occupation\",\"value\":\"<!--IWLINK'\\\" 0--><sup id=\\\"cite&#95;ref-Cast&#95;1-0\\\" class=\\\"reference\\\"><a href=\\\"#cite_note-Cast-1\\\"><span class=\\\"cite-bracket\\\">&#91;<\\/span>1<span class=\\\"cite-bracket\\\">&#93;<\\/span><\\/a><\\/sup>\",\"span\":1,\"layout\":null,\"item-name\":null,\"source\":\"occupation\"}}],\"layout\":\"default\",\"collapse\":\"open\",\"row-items\":null,\"item-name\":null}},{\"type\":\"navigation\",\"data\":{\"value\":\"<small><span class=\\\"plainlinks\\\"><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\" class=\\\"text\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/starwars.fandom.com\\/wiki\\/Template:Person\\\">[Source]<\\/a><\\/span><\\/small>\",\"item-name\":null,\"source\":null}}],\"metadata\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"sources\":{\"image\":{\"label\":\"\",\"primary\":true}}},{\"type\":\"title\",\"sources\":{\"name\":{\"label\":\"\",\"primary\":true}}},{\"type\":\"group\",\"metadata\":[{\"type\":\"header\",\"sources\":[]},{\"type\":\"data\",\"sources\":{\"birth\":{\"label\":\"Born\",\"primary\":true}}},{\"type\":\"data\",\"sources\":{\"death\":{\"label\":\"Died\",\"primary\":true}}},{\"type\":\"data\",\"sources\":{\"listedpronouns\":{\"label\":\"Listed pronouns\",\"primary\":true}}},{\"type\":\"data\",\"sources\":{\"nationality\":{\"label\":\"Nationality\",\"primary\":true}}}]},{\"type\":\"group\",\"metadata\":[{\"type\":\"header\",\"sources\":[]},{\"type\":\"data\",\"sources\":{\"occupation\":{\"label\":\"Occupation\",\"primary\":true}}},{\"type\":\"data\",\"sources\":{\"companies\":{\"label\":\"Companies\",\"primary\":true}}},{\"type\":\"data\",\"sources\":{\"website\":{\"label\":\"Official website\",\"primary\":true}}}]},{\"type\":\"navigation\",\"sources\":[]}]}]"}}]}}